  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kenya Urban Water and Sanitation OBA Fund for Low Income Areas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objective is to increase the number of people in low income areas with access to improved water supply and sanitation services in Kenyan towns and cities. This objective will be realized by incentivizing urban Water Services Providers to invest in water supply and sanitation improvement subprojects to benefit households in low income areas by applying one-off Output-Based Aid subsidies to make water and sanitation access affordable.</narrative>
  </description>
